[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    545[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// stdout is a pipe whose read end is already closed. A C program keeps the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    546[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// default `SIGPIPE` disposition and dies from signal 13; the Rust runtime
