[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    139[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   arguments change nothing.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    140[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * **No error path writes to stderr and the exit status is always 0.** Absent the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    141[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   two signal/stream issues above, stderr is empty and the status is 0 for every
